{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cbt","name":"Biblica® 聖經，當代譯本開放資源","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbt","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbt","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CBT","englishName":"Chinese, Mandarin: Biblica® 聖經,當代譯本開放資源 (Bible)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"b36dae22680d13a66a36842989888505161ddf7eefb726364331d95aae2197c4","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":30961,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"LEV","translationId":"cmn_cbt","name":"利未記","commonName":"利未記","title":"利未記","order":3,"numberOfChapters":27,"sha256":"27679654bd4a243e5f935565bf0199f4689dc466438245b0da235429f33fe2d8","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/LEV/1.json","lastChapterNumber":27,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/LEV/27.json","totalNumberOfVerses":856},"chapter":{"number":12,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["產婦潔淨的條例"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":["耶和華對摩西說："]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":["「你把以下條例告訴以色列人。 「如果有婦人生了男嬰，她就要不潔淨七天，像在經期內不潔淨一樣。"]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":["第八天，嬰兒要接受割禮。"]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":["婦人因產後流血，要等三十三天才能潔淨。其間，不可接觸任何聖物，也不可進入聖所。"]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":["如果婦人生的是女嬰，她就要不潔淨十四天，像在經期內不潔淨一樣。她因產後流血，要等六十六天才能潔淨。"]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":["她不論生男生女，潔淨期滿後，都要預備一隻一歲的羊羔作燔祭、一隻雛鴿或斑鳩作贖罪祭，帶到會幕門口交給祭司。"]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":["祭司要在耶和華面前獻祭，為她贖罪，她的流血狀況才算潔淨。這是有關產婦生男生女的條例。"]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":["她若負擔不起一隻羊羔，可以帶兩隻斑鳩或雛鴿來，一隻作燔祭，一隻作贖罪祭。祭司為她贖罪後，她就潔淨了。」"]}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/LEV/12.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/LEV/13.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/LEV/11.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":8}